# Wrangler / Cloudflare
.wrangler/
.dev.vars

# Dependencies and build output (this project has no build step; kept in case
# a toolchain is added later)
node_modules/
dist/
# `spike/` was ignored here on the assumption these pages get deleted once they
# have answered their question. They are kept instead: ⑤ and ⑥ were each
# reopened by a later finding, and a probe that is already calibrated against
# this phone is worth more than the shelf space.

# web/models/ is deliberately VENDORED, not ignored — the comment that used to
# sit here claimed the bundle was "fetched by script" and no such script has
# ever existed. Upstream ships no prebuilt KWS wasm in any release (checked
# v1.12.27 -> v1.13.8), and this build is patched on top of that anyway: the
# VAD symbols are exported from wasm/kws/CMakeLists.txt so both engines live in
# one binary. Reproducing it means emsdk 4.0.23 and a source build, not a
# download — recipe in docs/hardware.md. 18 MB once; the model release and the
# emsdk version are both pinned, so it changes about never. While it was
# ignored, `git clone && wrangler pages deploy` shipped a site whose models 404
# at runtime, with nothing failing at build time to say so.

# Connectivity-test fixture audio: each person's own voice, recorded locally
# per web/fixtures/README.md, never someone else's sample.
web/fixtures/*.wav

# Personal design notes and specs (Chinese, single-author working documents)
docs/design-notes/
docs/superpowers/

# OS and editors
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
